Open Vanilla 0058: Boss Fights - combat in the Gurubashi hangout no longer cancels a pop. A swing at a practice dummy
or a fill bot's pull there made someone "not ready" and every bot-filled raid went back to the queue (live test,
2026-10-23). At the pop, combat in the hangout is stopped instead; combat anywhere else still counts. A cancelled
pop now logs who and why.

diff --git a/src/game/OpenVanilla/BossFights.cpp b/src/game/OpenVanilla/BossFights.cpp
index 3f4a081..52a1dd4 100644
--- a/src/game/OpenVanilla/BossFights.cpp
+++ b/src/game/OpenVanilla/BossFights.cpp
